WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
The world is freezing with temperatures of minus 70 degrees Celsius

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,800
When everyone else is fighting for a bite of food

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,200
But I was eating steak and drinking red wine in Bao Lei

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,800
Others work hard just to get a bite

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,400
But I can still choose the best to eat

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,800
The goddess wanted to take advantage of her beauty

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,000
Come and exchange for a bite of food with me

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,400
But even if I throw it away

9
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,200
I'm not going to give her a bite of food either.

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,600
The reason is that in the previous life

11
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,800
The end of the world is coming

12
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,200
Food and enemies have become the most evil things in the world

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,400
Many people died

14
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,460
And what really makes me remember all this

15
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,460
Not just the apocalypse itself

16
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:31,860
This is the end of the material depletion method

17
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:34,700
Even if it’s just the help I gave them in the first place

18
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,500
He's actually treating me right

19
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:45,510
Wasn't I beaten to death?

20
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:54,290
This is rebirth

21
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:57,210
There is still a full month until the end.

22
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:58,810
The first thing to consider is

23
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,010
How can I prepare myself for the apocalypse that will come in a month?

24
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:02,210
Live well in it

25
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:04,010
There are still several million left in Qiu's savings.

26
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:05,210
But the end is coming

27
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:07,410
There will be a huge shortage of supplies around the world

28
00:01:07,410 --> 00:01:12,860
a space

29
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:14,260
It seems that after I was reborn

30
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,660
Have some special abilities

31
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:17,060
With this huge space

32
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:23,210
It’s so convenient to store supplies for the doomsday

33
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:25,010
It will be the end in one month

34
00:01:25,010 --> 00:01:26,610
There are many delicious things to eat quickly

35
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:28,210
Otherwise, there will be no chance in the future.

36
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:30,210
Why are you so critical of yourself?

37
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:31,810
This and this and this

38
00:01:31,810 --> 00:01:34,260
Get the most expensive one

39
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,260
Zhang Yima

40
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,860
Is Zhang Yi so rich?

41
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:38,860
Yuqing, you are so lucky

42
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:40,060
That sweet dog chasing you

43
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:42,060
It turned out to be an invisible rich second generation, right?

44
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,260
Don’t we often see people like this in TV dramas?

45
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:45,660
Obviously he is very rich

46
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:46,860
But to find true love

47
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,460
So I pretended to be ordinary Yuqing

48
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:49,660
Let’s go in and find Zhang Yi

49
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:50,660
Isn't this bad?

50
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:52,860
It's easy for him to think that I'm a woman who worships money, right?

51
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:54,060
We are waiting outside

52
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:55,660
Pretend that we met her by chance

53
00:01:56,750 --> 00:01:57,950
Go to the nearby supermarket first

54
00:01:57,950 --> 00:02:01,460
Buy some supplies and go back.

55
00:02:01,460 --> 00:02:08,260
Zhang Yi, what a coincidence

56
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:09,660
In my previous life, I was the woman in front of me

57
00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:12,660
Fang Yuqing tricked me into opening the door and caused Zhang Yi’s tragic death.

58
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:15,460
Where are you going? It’s such a coincidence that you’re going to the supermarket.

59
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:17,960
We are also going to buy something Zhang Yi

60
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,960
Were you having dinner with someone just now?

61
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,160
Can't I eat it myself?

62
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,960
Oops, that’s not what I meant.

63
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,560
It's just that the things there are quite expensive.

64
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,560
I thought you were inviting someone to dinner.

65
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,560
That meal just now

66
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,760
I'll have to eat up half a year's salary from the looks of it.

67
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:31,360
Your family has a lot of money left for you.

68
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,360
Hahaha I was just kidding

69
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,960
Zhang Yi, why did you buy so much food?

70
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,760
Are you going camping?

71
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,760
Will the rich second generation eat these when camping?

72
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,160
Zhang Yi, do you need my help?

73
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,790
Then help me push the car, Zhang Yi

74
00:02:43,790 --> 00:02:45,490
How many people need to eat this much food?

75
00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:46,690
Do you have any activities?

76
00:02:46,690 --> 00:02:48,220
Didn't tell me

77
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:49,720
Unforeseen circumstances may arise

78
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,620
What if the world ends one day?

79
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:54,740
I’ll stock up on more stuff to live by, hahaha

80
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:56,540
Oops, forget it if you don’t want to say it

81
00:02:56,540 --> 00:02:57,740
Why are you kidding like this?

82
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:59,740
It’s just that I helped you so much today

83
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:02,140
You have to treat me to dinner later, okay, okay

84
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:04,840
But I'm quite busy lately and don't have much time next month, maybe?

85
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,840
OK, OK

86
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:13,800
Let's buy something together

87
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:16,000
Now I don’t care if people find me hoarding goods.

88
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:18,400
After all, these two women know about their shopping

89
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,400
It’s no longer possible to hide the news from Xiao Zhang.

90
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,100
Why did you bring so many things back?

91
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:23,400
You can't use up all this much

92
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,800
Otherwise, share some points with the neighbors.

93
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,900
Sorry

94
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:27,700
I keep these things for myself to eat
